			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Unify request parameter parsing in WindowUI and Workspace\n\nReplace inline conditional logic for unwrapping JSON arrays and normalizing URI parameters with new utility functions in the `Utilities::Params` module. Introduce `array_unwrap`, `uri_from_params`, and `ensure_array` to handle inconsistent caller formats (`[payload]`, `{uri:…}`, or bare values) across the IPC dispatch layer.\n\nUpdate `WindowUI.rs` and `Workspace.rs` to utilize these centralized helpers for `ShowNotification` and `$updateWorkspaceFolders` handling. This eliminates duplicated `if/else` type checks, reduces boilerplate, and ensures consistent argument normalization for all Tauri event handlers invoking the UI and workspace effects.",
			"SHA": "ec4b4bead018abce752275cebcadd98fe083e503"
